      "lines": [
        "2) 哪个数值大？是$\\frac{13}{14}$还是$\\frac{15}{16}$；是$\\frac{13}{15}$还是$\\frac{19}{21}$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1160",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1160. 下面的说法是真的吗？",
        "1) 两个数乘积的倒数等于各因数的倒数的乘积；",
        "2) 两个数的和的倒数等于各加数的倒数的和；",
        "3) 两个数乘积的相反数等于各因数的相反数的乘积；",
        "4) 两数的和的相反数等于各加数的相反数的和。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1161",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1161. 解方程：",
        "1) $\\frac{x-0.8}{x+0.2}=\\frac{6.3}{11.4}$； 2) $\\frac{k-1.2}{3.2}=\\frac{k-3.45}{1.7}$；",
        "3) $\\frac{10.5}{y-3.6}=\\frac{51}{y+1.8}$； 4) $\\frac{2x-3.2}{1.2}=\\frac{5x-6}{0.5}$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1162",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1162. 计算：",
        "1) $[2.727:(-0.9)+1.9\\cdot(-5.3)+1.58]:4.8$；",
        "2) $4.2\\cdot(-0.3):0.9-5.6:(-1.4)\\cdot3.7$；",
        "3) $-\\frac{3}{14}\\cdot\\frac{7}{9}-\\frac{8}{15}:\\left(-\\frac{4}{5}\\right)+\\frac{1}{12}$；",
        "4) $-\\frac{11}{13}:\\left(-1\\frac{9}{13}\\right)+5.52:(-13.8)-0.1$；",
        "5) $(12.8:0.64+12.6:9)\\cdot(302.4:0.9-84.5)+4.45$；",
        "6) $[11.21-(38.418:0.3-4.8\\cdot11.6):11.3]+13.79$；",
        "7) $(156.6:18-8.6)\\cdot100:0.1-99$；",
        "8) $0.75\\cdot12.5:0.625+67.25-81.75+(3.45-4.65):6$；",
        "9) $\\left(7-4\\frac{3}{4}\\right)\\cdot1\\frac{1}{3}+\\left(6-4\\frac{2}{5}\\right):1\\frac{1}{3}$；",
        "10) $10-3\\frac{3}{4}\\cdot\\left(2\\frac{1}{3}+1\\frac{2}{5}\\right):1\\frac{5}{9}$；"
      ]
    },
